     |               ^ provided: this value is local here
 --> ../../conformance/CLO/CLO-4-stored-borrowed-capture-bad.hir:12:15
  12 |       let _ = x
     |               ^ required: taking moves the value out of its owner
  = help: 1. write `copy x` here (no deep copy: it shares `x` by a count; needed because `x` is borrowed at this use: it is a part, an element, borrowed storage, or used again later)
  = help: share the value by a count (replace with "copy ")
